<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randgold ends due diligence on RMP buy.</title>
<headline>Randgold ends due diligence on RMP buy.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Randgold and Exploration Company Ltd said on Tuesday it had completed due diligence relating to the acquisition of land clearing and gold-recovery operations of RMP Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>It said negotiations on the RMP buy were being concluded, adding that satisfactory progress was also being made in matters relating to the purchase of Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Randgold and Australian-based Continental Goldfields, which has an indirect 29 percent stake in Knights, said in a cautionary notice shareholders should continue to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
